<title>BRAZIL: Banco do Brasil May net 41.29 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Banco do Brasil May net 41.29 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federally owned Banco do Brasil said Monday it posted a net profit in May of 41.29 million reais, or 0.06 reais per 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that May earnings brought its net profit for the first five months of the year to 155.29 million reais.</p>
<p>No comparative figures for May 1996 or the January-May period last year were given.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
